<p>חינוך ולדורף אמור לענות על צרכים עמוקים של התלמידים, גם כאלה שאין התלמידים מודעים להם, טוען שטיינר (1956):</p>
<p><em>&quot;On the art of teaching about which is being spoken here, the most important thing is to nature the concealed in the child and his development. From this, it is incumbent upon teaching to stand totally in service of education. In fact, we educate, and the lesson, the teaching, we exploit in order to educate.&quot;</em></p>
