  <section class="card lib-attach">
    <h2 id="sec-1un8u7o">הקבצים המקוריים</h2>
    <p>הקבצים שצורפו לפריט באתר הישן.</p>
    <ul class="lib-files">
      <li><svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/></svg> <a href="./wp-content/uploads/2022/06/%D7%A2%D7%91%D7%95%D7%93%D7%AA-%D7%92%D7%9E%D7%A8-%D7%99%D7%A2%D7%9C-%D7%94%D7%A8%D7%9F.docx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">עבודת-גמר-יעל-הרן</a> <span class="lib-ext">DOCX</span></li>
    </ul>
